---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <section>
    <a href="/drones" class="back-link">&larr; Back</a>
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;">Drone Clips</h1>
    
    <div class="video-grid">
      
      <!-- Video Item 1 -->
        <div class="video-card">
        <h3>The Zone FPV Sim: Top 100 on All 6 Tracks</h3>
        <div class="video-wrapper">
            <iframe 
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/6qARtnDhQKg?si=i9MNEUyIQVxmxcYH"
            title="YouTube video player" 
            frameborder="0" 
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" 
            allowfullscreen>
            </iframe>
        </div>
        <description><a href='https://store.steampowered.com/app/3491280/The_Zone__FPV_Drone_Simulator/' 
        target='_blank' style='color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;'>The Zone</a> is 
        an FPV simulator known for its very realistic drone physics compared to other simulators, and it's definitely the best for 
        improving in-real-life flying in my opinion. Although the map selection or graphics are not nearly as good as other titles. Here are my racing PBs after some practice. </description>
        </div>

        <!-- Video Item 2 -->
        <div class="video-card">
        <h3>First Tinywhoop Edit</h3>
        <div class="video-wrapper">
            <iframe 
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/xbIWS9DlHoU?si=IvxrVXPaeo8aYKIO"
            title="YouTube video player" 
            frameborder="0" 
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" 
            allowfullscreen>
            </iframe>
        </div>
        <description>These were the first clips I got with my new tinywhoop with just over a week of flying. </description>
        </div>

        <!-- Video Item 3 -->
        <div class="video-card">
        <h3>Toyota Altezza Edit</h3>
        <div class="video-wrapper">
            <iframe 
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/9cZSFQcVPoA?si=s72a4JDXO4TFlXp_"
            title="YouTube video player" 
            frameborder="0" 
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" 
            allowfullscreen>
            </iframe>
        </div>
        <description>Filmed my friends JDM car. </description>
        </div>

        <!-- Video Item 4 -->
        <div class="video-card">
        <h3>Asetto Corsa FPV</h3>
        <div class="video-wrapper">
            <iframe 
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/x6ocakStPm4?si=CIY6mHGRcYg8G-v2"
            title="YouTube video player" 
            frameborder="0" 
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" 
            allowfullscreen>
            </iframe>
        </div>
        <description>Wanted to learn to film more drifting. I downloaded and FPV mod for Asetto Corsa and went to online servers to chase cars. 
        Just some simple clips made into an edit. </description>
        </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .back-link {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  
  .back-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .video-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .video-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .video-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .video-card description {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .video-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%; 
  }

  .video-wrapper video, .video-wrapper iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: none;
  }
</style>